n{aligned} & x+y+z=6 \\\\  & y+z=5 \\\\  & z=3,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand we can apply back substitution. The final equation $z=3$ tells us the value of $z.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\ny+(3)=5\\,⟹\\,y=5-3=2.\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting both $y=2$ and $z=3$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx+(2)+(3)=6\\,⟹\\,x=6-5=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=1,y=2$ and $z=3.$" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374536 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374537 13194139535922 true] [17592186374536 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374538 13194139535922 true] [17592186374536 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374539 13194139535922 true] [17592186374536 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374540 13194139535922 true] [17592186374536 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374541 13194139535922 true] [17592186374536 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535922 true] [17592186374536 1041 "selection" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374536 1104 #edb/ref 17592186374539 13194139535922 true] [17592186374536 1110 #uuid "12ccae99-0e09-5930-8e41-6f2ecc09369d" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374537 1034 "$x=1,y=6$ and $z=-1$" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374537 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535922 true] [17592186374537 1111 #uuid "819dcbf3-244b-56f3-bac9-c3460d9a6b07" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374538 1034 "$x=1,y=8$ and $z=-3$" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374538 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535922 true] [17592186374538 1111 #uuid "333ab59b-93f1-5fba-9c9b-4b5d12fb6180" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374539 1034 "$x=1,y=2$ and $z=3$" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374539 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535922 true] [17592186374539 1111 #uuid "ff6ffb27-91bf-5103-93ac-3c2f05784d25" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374540 1034 "$x=1,y=4$ and $z=1$" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374540 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535922 true] [17592186374540 1111 #uuid "4cf448e5-07e9-53c1-aa13-a28d056b96a2" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374541 1034 "$x=1,y=5$ and $z=0$" 13194139535922 true] [17592186374541 1103 #edb/